Z||000006||DXR_DAD||01-25-2001||11:44 PM||||Carl, They were done at a shop. There is padding the vinyl, it is a high quality vinly<BR>not leather  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. The top seam is folded under I dont think it will look good just cut!!.<BR>When working with the vinyl they use heat to form it around curves, A thin piece of plastic was cut to the same shape of the top curve and then glued on top of the folded over edge of vinyl, (I hope you understand that)??? then the padding and then glued to panel<P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||14
